{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"神舟二十四號載人飛船成功與太空站交會對接\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CN-DOCKING-261125-14.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】神舟二十四號載人飛船成功與太空站交會對接。</p><p>飛船靠近太空站天和核心艙，之後精準對接並鎖緊，在上午11時56分成功對接太空站，整個對接過程歷時3.5小時。</p><p>神舟二十四號3名航天員在艙壓調整好之後，將會進入天和核心艙，而神舟二十三號航天員已做好準備迎接他們，實現「太空會師」。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:03:59.078247+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:18:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T07:37:29.915189+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:57:25.870115+00:00","content_hash":"ff58593506784db5ba2f13dddb38e5c3cf1cd515662499d4b1695ca8a143f59b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}